  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "$\\ce{CH3OH(g) ->[催化剂, 700°C] CH2O(g) + H2(g)}$"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "$\\Delta H_m^\\ominus = 84.2\\ \\mathrm{kJ\\ mol^{-1}}$  (1)"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "向体系中通入空气,通过以下反应提供反应(1)所需热量:"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "$\\ce{H2(g) + 0.5 O2(g) -> H2O(g)}$"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "$\\Delta H_m^\\ominus = -241.8\\ \\mathrm{kJ\\ mol^{-1}}$  (2)"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "要使反应温度维持在 $700^\\circ\\mathrm{C}$,计算进料中甲醇与空气的摩尔数之比。已知空气中氧气的体积分数为0.20。"
    }
  ],
